    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778220/extras/d00c0bb66825b2f9de077e61a053d6c1.webp?t=1753171668\" width=480 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Palm Sugar: A Village Story&quot; you embark on an exciting journey across the vibrant and colorful region of South India. Set in a small village gripped by the iron fist of a vicious drug cartel, you play as Srinu, a young and adventurous boy. Wield weapons, meet compelling characters, and navigate through dialogue-heavy levels, filled with humor and sarcasm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778220/extras/c438917c91296e9f5db7aa52a48cb903.webp?t=1753171668\" width=480 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Culture:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the vibrant culture of South India.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience captivating dialogues charged with humor, morals, and wit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an array of unconventional weapons such as sticks, axes, and slingshots.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple RPG-System:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are implementing a simple RPG system, featuring a creative inventory where players trade quest items and craft tools and weapons to progress through missions and levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the triumphs and disasters of a boy named Srinu. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778220/extras/f080583f711c47ccf4d9130eb84ba1f0.avif?t=1753171668\" width=480 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Localization and Cultural Nuances:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Palm Sugar&quot; transcends gaming by fully embracing the cultural nuances of South India. The game is thoughtfully localized in Telugu, English, and Hindi ensuring players can deeply connect with the dialogues and cultural references. The narrative draws inspiration from iconic figures, seamlessly integrating Telugu cinema's wit and wisdom into the gaming experience.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778220/extras/d00c0bb66825b2f9de077e61a053d6c1.webp?t=1753171668\" width=480 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Palm Sugar: A Village Story&quot; you embark on an exciting journey across the vibrant and colorful region of South India. Set in a small village gripped by the iron fist of a vicious drug cartel, you play as Srinu, a young and adventurous boy. Wield weapons, meet compelling characters, and navigate through dialogue-heavy levels, filled with humor and sarcasm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778220/extras/c438917c91296e9f5db7aa52a48cb903.webp?t=1753171668\" width=480 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Culture:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the vibrant culture of South India.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience captivating dialogues charged with humor, morals, and wit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an array of unconventional weapons such as sticks, axes, and slingshots.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple RPG-System:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are implementing a simple RPG system, featuring a creative inventory where players trade quest items and craft tools and weapons to progress through missions and levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the triumphs and disasters of a boy named Srinu. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778220/extras/f080583f711c47ccf4d9130eb84ba1f0.avif?t=1753171668\" width=480 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Localization and Cultural Nuances:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Palm Sugar&quot; transcends gaming by fully embracing the cultural nuances of South India. The game is thoughtfully localized in Telugu, English, and Hindi ensuring players can deeply connect with the dialogues and cultural references. The narrative draws inspiration from iconic figures, seamlessly integrating Telugu cinema's wit and wisdom into the gaming experience.</p>",
    "short_description": "In Palm Sugar, you play as Srinu, a young and resolute boy. Your beloved village has been taken over by a vicious drug cartel. Go on a perilous journey across South India and dive into its rich and colorful culture. The fate of the village and its people rests in your hands.",
